  "description": "[FAST TRACK] ERECTION OF SINGLE STOREY REAR EXTENSION [6.0M IN DEPTH, MAXIMUM HEIGHT OF 3.5M AND EAVES HEIGHT OF 3.0M]",
  "development_type": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Due to the excessive depth and height of the proposed extension along the shared boundary with adjoining No. 410 Malden Road, and in the absence of sufficient information including a 45-degree assessment and accurate elevational relationship, it is considered that the proposed development would result in a loss of daylight and an unacceptable overbearing impact. The proposal has therefore failed to demonstrate that it would not adversely impact the amenity of neighbouring occupiers, thereby conflicting with Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021) and Policy DM10 of the Core Strategy (2012)."
